      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hey, I stream w/ the VRChat camera, and its default size is unusably small if you move around a significant amount. A toggle to +/- the size w/ a few size options would be amazing. It can live where the rest of the lower buttons are. It's honestly critical to my streaming",
