  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-25T19:43:21.086Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Being honest, I think the camera on VR is a little too small, not all of us can really see that good and maybe an option to change the size of the camera can work and more if we like to take good photos and want to see every detail to make it perfect.",
